  data: {
    LLM: "Watch other players' reactions when they see your card. If they look confident, your card is probably low. If they look disappointed, your card might be high.\n\nRead betting patterns. Players betting aggressively likely see weak cards on others' foreheads. Players checking may see strong cards and be cautious.\n\nBluffing and reverse psychology. Control your reactions when seeing others' cards. Bet confidently with a low card if others appear uncertain.",
    Player: "Watch other players' reactions when they see your card. If they look confident, your card is probably low. If they look disappointed, your card might be high.\n\nRead betting patterns. Players betting aggressively likely see weak cards on others' foreheads. Players checking may see strong cards and be cautious.\n\nBluffing and reverse psychology. Control your reactions when seeing others' cards. Bet confidently with a low card if others appear uncertain.",
